Package: bootmac
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bluez, udev, systemd
Description: Configure WLAN and Bluetooth MAC addresses at boot
 Configures the MAC addresses of WLAN and Bluetooth interfaces at boot
 for devices without persistent MAC storage (Xiaomi Pad 6 / pipa).
